WEBVTT

00:37:05.204 --> 00:37:07.663
I hope to get a recording of this,

00:37:07.663 --> 00:37:10.413
so the next time I need to decide whether

00:37:10.413 --> 00:37:13.913
I should keep that old car
of mine or whatever,

00:37:14.204 --> 00:37:16.871
I will not fall into the same traps that

00:37:16.871 --> 00:37:24.788
I have spent my research career trying to
create lessons about how to avoid that.

00:37:25.704 --> 00:37:29.746
I think there's there's no better person
to be persuaded by than someone you

00:37:29.746 --> 00:37:32.079
know well and trust a lot yourself.